{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It\u2019s always more fun to throw a snowball than to be hit by one!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toaplan\u2019s hit Snow Bros is back! This arcade-style, fixed-screen platformer follows brothers Nick and Tom through epic levels in the Kingdom of Hottoda to save two trapped princesses, each possessing the magic of snow\u2026 and the only hope for the realm. As evil King Atchich seeks to take over the world, the snowmen we love must set out to storm the enemy\u2019s fortress and rescue their princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot snow at your enemies, picking up items to enhance your fighting, from speed enhancements to shot powerups, becoming giant, and more. Each level features not only enemies but a boss fight, with unique characters to size up and snowball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you have loved them since the 90s or are just discovering the snowy goodness now, Snow Bros will show you exactly why it\u2019s such a timeless game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3233400?t=1768237059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233400/57f048f6d26fa3f07b517bf6f7d44dfab5a3e045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768237059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233400/f9d5a889d0b01ee497e9f2b35da85a67f20deb0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768237059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233400/f9d5a889d0b01ee497e9f2b35da85a67f20deb0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768237059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It\u2019s always more fun to throw a snowball than to be hit by one!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toaplan\u2019s hit Snow Bros is back! This arcade-style, fixed-screen platformer follows brothers Nick and Tom through epic levels in the Kingdom of Hottoda to save two trapped princesses, each possessing the magic of snow\u2026 and the only hope for the realm. As evil King Atchich seeks to take over the world, the snowmen we love must set out to storm the enemy\u2019s fortress and rescue their princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot snow at your enemies, picking up items to enhance your fighting, from speed enhancements to shot powerups, becoming giant, and more. Each level features not only enemies but a boss fight, with unique characters to size up and snowball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you have loved them since the 90s or are just discovering the snowy goodness now, Snow Bros will show you exactly why it\u2019s such a timeless game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Headless Chicken Games","Toaplan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233400/0f4ca33a8706fc3a969f1f2ba5e3ef3ac41697c7/header.jpg?t=1768237059","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3233400/748483535/7f184448d1a888c818de9e12ee5856adb2f03efa/1767633376/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768237057","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3233400/748483535/7f184448d1a888c818de9e12ee5856adb2f03efa/1767633376/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768237057","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3233400/748483535/7f184448d1a888c818de